<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">As your personal admission counselor at Arizona State University, I am here to help you navigate the process and answer any questions you may have. Here is some information on your next steps.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Next steps for enrollment</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Pay your enrollment deposit on <a href="https://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> in your <b>Priority Tasks</b> box.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Apply for <a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/apply/freshmen">financial aid</a> by filing your FAFSA (Free Application for Federal Student Aid) at <a href="https://fafsa.ed.gov/">fafsa.ed.gov</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">See a full list of <a href="https://students.asu.edu/admitted">next steps for enrollment</a>.</span></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#ff0000"><b>&lt;&lt;ONLY KEEP THE FOLLOWING PARAGRAPHS IF RELEVANT TO THE STUDENT&gt;&gt;</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><b>Scholarships&nbsp;</b></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Use the <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/estimator">scholarship estimator</a> to see potential merit-based scholarships. If you qualify for a scholarship, you will receive a letter in the mail approximately two weeks after you are admitted.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Apply for additional scholarships using ASU’s <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/">Scholarship Search Portal</a>.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Barrett, The Honors College</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you are interested in ASU's <a href="http://barretthonors.asu.edu/">Barrett, The Honors College</a> and have not yet applied, <a href="http://barretthonors.asu.edu/admissions/">view admission and application information</a> online.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Congratulations again on your admission to ASU. If you have any questions, let me know and I’ll be happy to help!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>